WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.060
Doubting his abilities,

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.200
Üso decided he didn't want to help the adults in their war.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:36.130
But in the attack by Pippiniden, who had just arrived at Largaine Base,

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:41.000
Marbet fell into danger and it was Üso who helped her.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.400
And he emerged stronger for it.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.930
DEPARTURE

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.160
"Departure".
DEPARTURE

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.260
DEPARTURE

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:09.400
Hey, can't we fly to Kasarelia?

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:12.100
The Camion's trying to get there secretly, so we can't.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.260
Here.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.300
What are you doing?

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.930
Washing my face!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.060
Shahkti, have you been eating well?

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.230
What?

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.130
Are you trying to kill us?!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.030
S-Sorry! You didn't fall, though.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.160
Odelo, you can let go!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.160
Really?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:39.760
Yeah!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.500
Okay, put us down!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.260
I'm gonna scout around. Catch up with me later.

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.500
Point Kasarelia...

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:12.960
Where I suffered the most humiliating experience of my career.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:27.500
Ltjg. Cronicle, do you read? This is Commander Fuala Griffon.

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:28.160
Yes.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:33.760
Enjoy your stroll, but rendezvous with the Recarl in 30 minutes.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:34.430
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:39.400
Once our engines are warmed up, we'll get on course for Arti Gibraltar.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.660
We won't be waiting at the rendezvous point?

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:45.230
Ltjg. Cronicle will catch up with us.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:49.000
Okay, all units, scout your surroundings.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:49.830
Roger! Roger!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:56.500
I appreciate you taking me from Largaine base to see my home.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:57.400
It's all right.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.900
Lieutenant, come in.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:03:59.830
What's up?

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:03.200
There's smoke rising from a house by the cliffs to the southeast.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.000
On my way. The rest of you, continue searching the area.

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:06.900
Roger!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.960
If there is a future...

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:25.200
On the other side of the stars...

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:30.060
The young ones...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.000
There, there.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:36.900
The heartbreaking feelings that people have...

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.130
There we go.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.200
Oh, did you wet yourself again?

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.030
Haro! Haro! Haro! Haro!

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.500
When Üso gets back...

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:54.060
Wait... Are those beam rotors?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.930
Why are they here?

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.060
Miss Katejina is with him?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.630
An illegal immigrant's house.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:29.000
Haro! Haro! Haro! Haro!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.300
You!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:37.060
Shahkti, where are the others?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.230
Miss Katejina.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:43.230
This is the man who saved you in the underground factory.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.630
Oh. You're that girl.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.960
This is the third time I've run into you.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.360
It must be fate.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.830
Good dog.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:29.130
Just one Zolo-type... Why'd it land out here?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.560
There are three of them?!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.100
The white one's here!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.160
And it looks like it's fully-equipped!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.300
Look! Seems like we hit the jackpot!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.530
Ouch!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:17.960
Üso?

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.560
That white one's here?

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:41.000
What? It's Miss Katejina. What's she doing here?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:44.900
Üso!

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.030
Üso! Üso!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.430
Üso, open your eyes!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.730
Hi. I'm back.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.300
Üso!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.730
Üso, thank goodness!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.200
It's okay. Looks like I didn't get hurt.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.060
You! Miss Katejina!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:14.600
Why are you with a Yellow Jacket?! Are you their prisoner?!

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.130
What the old men on the Camion are doing...

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.430
...will lead Earth to eternal hopelessness.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:26.660
So I decided to learn about the Zanscare's methods from this man.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.460
No... You can't!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.630
Don't you see how wrong that is?!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:36.530
At this rate... We'll never be able to advance.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.860
So you have to go with a man like him?!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:40.830
Üso, stop.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.660
Is that it, Miss Katejina?!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.500
Üso...

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.300
You know this boy?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:49.600
Y-Yes... He's also an illegal immigrant from this area.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.830
What about the pilot of the white mobile suit?

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:55.600
It seems, by the time we spotted it, he had already ran off.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.700
Only that boy was near it!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.060
Why did BESPA have to come here?!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.160
Out of the way!

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:10.530
Some scouting run. He let himself get captured!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:11.830
Now what?

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.100
I doubt they'd kill a bunch of kids on sight...

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:17.900
Victory's moving!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.760
Three Zolos, huh?

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.900
We'll just have to save him.

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:29.760
Save him?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.500
Odelo! But, how?

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.660
We're facing three mobile suits.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:38.400
Without people, mobile suits are just big dolls. Let's go!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:39.300
Odelo!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.360
It has such maneuverability even without beam rotors?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.630
The controls have such a light touch,

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.760
a child could probably operate it.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.660
A child?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:14.260
So, Ltjg. Cronicle captured the enemy mobile suit for me.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:15.930
Congratulations.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:19.260
Looks like this may save me from the guillotine.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.560
Yes, it does.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.900
The commander's happy to come out and meet us.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.160
How about a bite to eat?

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.030
Sure, it looks good.

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.230
Not bad. Did you make this, Miss?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.930
I made it for Üso.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.200
No problem. He can have some.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.500
How about you, Miss?

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.860
I'm not hungry.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.400
Lot of kids around here, huh?

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:55.630
Kids?

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.630
There are sheep running by.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.130
What are you doing with other people's sheep?!

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.700
Stealing's as bad as lying, you know!

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:04.900
Hi!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.160
That little brat!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.800
What's up, Ray?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:14.600
Ray!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.960
Don't tell me...

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.200
Sheep rustling, huh?

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.200
Little brat! Dammit!

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.930
They're not sheep rustlers!

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.800
If they're not sheep rustlers, then what are they, shrimp?

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:51.160
Don't move! Hit me again, and he loses his face!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.830
Damn...

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.360
Somebody, stop me!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.360
Suzy!

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:06.700
Why, you...

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:13.230
I couldn't be a sheep rustler without knowing how to fire one of these!

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.000
What are you going to do?

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:19.100
Into the cabin! Bring the unconscious one in with you!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:23.460
You might have the drop on me, but it's all over, kid.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.760
The third one's back!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:29.830
He's our friend, but rough enough that he'd let us die.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.700
What are you doing?

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.360
If we mass-produced this mobile suit,

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.360
the League Militaire wouldn't be worth thinking about.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.900
Üso, I take my eyes off you for a second, and you fly back here?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.900
Carelessly jumping around will get you spotted by the enemy!

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.030
Land, Üso!

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.960
Üso? You mean that boy is this mobile suit's pilot?!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.130
I told you not to jump!

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.060
W-What?

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.530
Who's in there?!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.100
You...

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.530
Dammit, this thing's so poorly maintained!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.460
Was it captured by the Yellow Jackets?!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.030
What?!

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:39.900
A Zolo!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:46.000
Unit 3! Kazu! Why are you blocking me?!

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:49.630
That's my suit! Now give it back!

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:55.330
Mr. Oliver, here! I'm in this one!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.960
The Zolo? You're in the Zolo?

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:01.700
The Victory-type was taken by the Yellow Jackets.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:02.960
How?

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.630
How? It just happened.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:06.400
Below you!

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.430
Üso!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.500
If the leg segment's keeping me from maintaining power and stability,

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:27.700
I'll jettison it!

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.460
What should I do?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.600
I have no choice.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.030
Is he making an emergency landing?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.960
Why isn't the leg segment separating?!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.830
Display manual!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:53.900
I'm gonna get killed while I read this!

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.860
Don't move! I swear, I'll shoot you!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.630
Can't I go to the bathroom?

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:02.100
Okay, but no funny moves.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.560
He's taking a while, huh?

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.230
Maybe he got shot down by the Victory.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:15.760
Time after time, Üso wriggles out of tight spots.

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.260
He'll be okay.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:22.030
If only a certain traitor hadn't brought the Yellow Jackets here!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.860
Coming here was Ltjg. Cronicle's decision alone.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:30.800
Sit!

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:36.030
What? What was that beam just now?

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.430
A beam stronger than the rifle!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.130
The leg's destroyed. That's not Üso.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:03.260
I wanted to bring this machine back with me, but...

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.430
You're not going anywhere!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:08.200
Stop! Odelo, stop!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.300
Katejina, what happened?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.800
Üso didn't get it, either! I need to do this to be a spy!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.530
You're spying?

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.160
You don't know my situation!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.030
Quit rationalizing it!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:26.530
Drop the gun, or I'll burn you alive!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:30.760
Shoot! Using a beam rifle at this range...

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.330
...will kill your precious prisoner Katejina, too!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.660
You arrogant child!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.530
You'd point a mobile suit's rifle at a kid?!

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:46.460
That Zolo is the enemy!

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:48.860
And I figured out the docking release!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.260
My machine!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.330
Come on, you stupid... Open!

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:27.060
What's that beam?

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.460
Haro! Haro!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:38.360
Odelo!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.560
If you want people to trust you,

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:44.800
then show us some results, Miss Katejina!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.900
Odelo!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.300
Üso, you're still fighting for those kids?

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.660
So, it's not just an ultra-long range beam!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.900
Warren, can you tell what sort of enemy is approaching?

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.860
I don't know. I could just see the beam.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.030
Is Üso piloting it, now?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.760
That white one's moving again?

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:36.560
I don't want to believe that kid is operating it!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.760
Mobile suit-like object approaching us from below.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:50.100
Probably Cronicle. We don't need his help to destroy one fighter.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.100
Sorry, but this machine is your enemy now!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.630
It's attacking!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:59.100
What?! I thought we controlled it now!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.400
Then shoot it down!

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.030
Yes!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:12.530
Damn!

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:17.330
Oh, no! They got my last balancer!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:28.760
Üso! Use this! Do you read?

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.100
Mr. Oliver!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.330
No, he's still moving.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.500
Oliver's unit?

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.860
No, both of them.

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:41.330
You two, fly in the Unit 1 Zolo helicopter!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.600
Yes, sir. Understood.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.300
Miss Katejina, come with us.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.860
Right.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.360
All right!

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.330
Okay, come on.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.100
Right.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.830
This is no place for you!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.930
Where the hell is Cronicle?!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.830
Fall! Fall!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:29.730
That Zolo!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.730
Miss Katejina!

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:13.530
Üso, can you move? Answer me!

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:14.900
Üso!

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:27.130
A letter to Üso from Miss Katejina?

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.660
Shahkti, we have to leave.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.000
Leave?

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:42.300
The Yellow Jackets know about this place now.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.430
We can't stay.

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:51.000
But, your mother won't know where we've gone.

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:56.700
If we leave willowherb, she'll find us wherever we go.

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:37.200
Separated from the Camion on the way to Arti Gibraltar,

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:41.430
Üso and I encounter an enemy unit.

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:46.800
And it's there that new allies in mobile suits appear...

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.430
...amidst the chaotic spectacle of battle.

